      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The massive and erratic latency spikes at hop 3 strongly suggest a significant issue at that gateway, which is likely your local router or firewall for the 192.168.45.0/24 subnet. This behavior is more indicative of hardware instability or heavy resource exhaustion rather than simple network congestion, as congestion usually causes more consistent delay increases. I recommend checking the CPU utilization and error logs on the device at 192.168.45.1 first.",
