    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "checked the CPU on 192.168.45.1 and it's sitting pretty low, around 15%. error logs aren't showing anything major either, just some occasional interface resets. \n\nthe jitter is still super inconsistent though. it's not a steady climb, it just jumps around randomly. could it be an intermittent physical layer issue, like a bad cable or something with the SFP module?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
